  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Weapon(Weighted Chain), Special Grade</em></p><p>These chains become indestructible when physically binding a creature with strong cursed energy. While wielding this weapon, you can use your action to make an attack roll using your Cursed Energy modifier against a target within 50 ft. A creature bound this way cannot use cursed energy until they escape (escape DC 20). The DC increases by +1 for every 10 cursed energy the target currently has.</p>"
